            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>Lee Chatmen is a popular influencer from the United States with over 7 million TikTok followers. He became famous for his entertaining videos, where he plays popular songs on miniature guitars. In 2023, Lee launched his own line of merchandise. This dashboard looks at how his merchandise sales are going and what we can learn from the data.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>Here are some key questions to guide the analysis:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>1. What are the overall sales trends?</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>2. Which product categories perform the best?</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>3. What are the most and least popular products?</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>4. How does location affect sales performance?</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>5. What impact does international shipping have on sales?</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>6. What is the demographic profile of buyers?</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>7. What are the trends in shipping charges?</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>Metrics explanation:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>a. Revenue = Quantity x Sales Price</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>b. Quantity = Quantity of Product Bought</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>c. Total Sales = Quantity x (Sales Price + Shipping Charges)</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>Data:</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>&#9;#onyxdata challenge</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>Icons:</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>&#9;svgrepo.com</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>Inspiration:&#9;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>https://dribbble.com/shots/16579956-Productivity-Dashboard-Design </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>Designed with </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ff2600' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>❤</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>by Gandes Goldestan</run>
              </formatted-text>
